<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES FLAT OR SLIGHTLY UP.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES FLAT OR SLIGHTLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two short Helibor rates rose at</p>
<p>the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The three-month</p>
<p>rate rose to 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>				 May 5 fix	   May 2 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		3.04 pct	    3.04 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		3.06 pct	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		3.09 pct	    3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		3.20 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		3.31 pct	    3.31 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	     3.42 pct	    3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
